// mautrix-slack, mautrix-discord, and mautrix-meta build against Beeper's forks of slack-go, discordgo, and req/v3;
// replace directives do not carry over from a dependency's go.mod, so they are repeated here at the versions those
// bridges pin.
replace github.com/slack-go/slack => github.com/beeper/slackgo v0.0.0-20260925001310-ea62f6cbc997

